s with beautifully realized 2D backgrounds.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/472420/extras/4497541944b4a94ce56c82bb6caacd63.avif?t=1771592456\" width=700 height=160 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic point-and-click game-play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voiced characters and cinematic storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-painted environments with 3D-animated characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humorous pirate-themed adventure with quirky puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful cast: jaguars, zombie sailors, gorilla wrestlers, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player experience perfect for fans of classic adventure games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements, trading cards and steam cloud syncing</p></li></ul>","developers":["Cateia Games"," Autumn Moon Entertainment","Jordan Freeman Group"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/472420/9e72d431c3cb9203766376cbd880b5717ad5ae63/header.jpg?t=1771592456","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Fortune Cookie d.o.o. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Any Linux Distro from 2012 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.4GHz Dual Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Any Linux Distro from 2012 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2GHz Quad Core<br></li><li><st